<title>USA: United Cos ends acquisition talks with Empire.</title>
<headline>United Cos ends acquisition talks with Empire.</headline>
<dateline>BATON ROUGE, La. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Cos Financial Corp said on Wednesday it terminated talks with  Empire Funding Corp for the proposed acquisition of Empire for $89 million in cash and stock.</p>
<p>The companies had entered into a non-binding letter of intent on Oct. 15.</p>
<p>Empire is a lender specializing in home improvement loans in Texas. United Cos Financial provides non-traditional consumer and mortgage loan products through the United States.</p>
</text>
